                                "card": {
                                    "card": {
                                        "@type": "type.googleapis.com/swiggy.gandalf.widgets.v2.SeoContent",
                                        "title": "About Bakingo",
                                        "description": "<section><h3>Best-Selling Dishes at Bakingo</h3><p>Bakingo is a popular food destination in Kaveri Vihar-1, Agra, known for serving delicious indian food. Customers can order from Bakingo for fresh preparation, satisfying portions, and flavorful dishes.</p><h3>Biscoff Cheesecake Jar</h3><p>Biscoff Cheesecake Jar is one of the popular dishes at Bakingo. It is prepared with quality ingredients and offers a satisfying taste for customers ordering from Kaveri Vihar-1.</p><h3>Chocolate Mud & Blueberry Mini Jar Cake Combo</h3><p>Chocolate Mud & Blueberry Mini Jar Cake Combo is another preferred item from the menu. It is a good choice for customers looking to enjoy tasty indian food in Agra.</p><h3>Why Customers Love Ordering from Bakingo</h3><p>Customers prefer Bakingo for its tasty food, reliable service, quick preparation, and menu choices. The restaurant serves indian dishes along with options such as biscuit, making it suitable for different food preferences.</p><h3>Enjoy Food from Bakingo at Home with Swiggy</h3><p>Swiggy makes it easy to order food from Bakingo in Agra. Customers can browse the menu, choose their favorite dishes, place an order online, make secure payments, track the order live, and enjoy doorstep delivery from Bakingo in Kaveri Vihar-1.</p><h3>Discover More Restaurants in Kaveri Vihar-1</h3><p>Kaveri Vihar-1 has many restaurants offering different cuisines, snacks, meals, desserts, and beverages. Customers exploring food delivery in Agra can discover more restaurants and order their favorite food online through Swiggy.</p></section>"
                                    }
                                }
